        "id": 71649,
        "name": "Facepalm",
        "username": "Facepalm",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/facepalm/{size}/2764_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-30T06:08:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><p><span>I'm surprised more people don't do hero vs. hero in teh regular game, it's rather easy and a lot of fun (esp. 2v2 or 1v1v1).</span></p></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That had never never occurred to me, and now I'm instantly dying to try it, if only to see how balanced the characters are in an average faceoff. It'd be brutal, though, given how well my group knows all the characters and their particular weaknesses and strengths.</p>",
