        "created_at": "2013-08-30T08:20:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"McBehrer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/48/1850_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> McBehrer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Spoilers: they aren't. Characters with reliable AoE, DR, redirection, and the like dominate the board. NightMist is just about game-breaking, and a well-timed Powered Shockwave will wipe everyone. Also, the Scholar.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's definitely news to me that these characters are in the game–were they playable at GenCon?</p>",
