        "id": 71652,
        "name": "Matchstickman",
        "username": "Matchstickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-30T09:14:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"PlatinumWarlock\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/48/1869_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> PlatinumWarlock:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It's definitely news to me that these characters are in the game–were they playable at GenCon?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>He was responding to the point about PvP in the card game. In the card game, they would not be balanced in a straight up fight.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>It occurs to me that if this is set years after the card game certain characters will not be around to play in Tactics, and possibly some characters in Tactics will never be seen in the card game.</p>",
