        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-30T09:27:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ah, thanks for the clarification.</p><p>And really? &nbsp;I can't imagine doing true hero vs hero matches in the card game. &nbsp;Could you really expect Argent Adept to actually go up against a damage dealer like Ra or Expatriette with a realistic chance of winning? &nbsp;Not going to happen.</p>",
