        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-30T09:40:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"PlatinumWarlock\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/48/1869_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> PlatinumWarlock:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And really? &nbsp;I can't imagine doing true hero vs hero matches in the card game. &nbsp;Could you really expect Argent Adept to actually go up against a damage dealer like Ra or Expatriette with a realistic chance of winning? &nbsp;Not going to happen.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Argent Adept needs at least one other hero on the team, but I could see him being quite powerful in a 2v2 game.</p>",
