      {
        "id": 71657,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-30T17:11:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think Visionary would&nbsp;stomp Ra, all she needs is Demoralizition and Tekekinectic Cocoon. Since Ra has now Ongoing Destruction, there is nothing he can do about it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Should put her in there as well, I've 1v1 her and Ra but I never got Cocoon, also Wrest the mind is game over if they can't destroy it. &nbsp;Cocoon was big in a 1v1v1 though, and Wrest the Mind is major fun. &nbsp;Legacy should be in that category too, but then I always seem to get Evolution before I die and then it is over.</p>\n<p>2v2 is my favorite by far, so many great combos.</p>",
        "post_number": 29,
        "post_type": 1,
