        "created_at": "2013-09-04T17:39:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>@<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/users/phantaskippy\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" title=\"View user profile.\">phantaskippy</a>You are correct; Bunker and Unity are both <em>awesome</em> and <em>super fun</em> in Tactics. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah!</p>\n<p>I want little miniature Chompers. &nbsp;They will be involved in the card game even.</p>",
